s52:s51,s50:oveq12d |- ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ Z e. CC /\ N e. NN ) -> ( ( ( sum_ i e. ( 1 ... N ) ( A ` i ) x. ( N ^c -u Z ) ) - ( sum_ i e. ( 1 ... 1 ) ( A ` i ) x. ( 1 ^c -u Z ) ) ) - sum_ j e. ( 1 ..^ N ) ( ( sum_ i e. ( 1 ... ( j + 1 ) ) ( A ` i ) - sum_ i e. ( 1 ... j ) ( A ` i ) ) x. ( ( j + 1 ) ^c -u Z ) ) ) = ( ( ( sum_ i e. ( 1 ... N ) ( A ` i ) x. ( N ^c -u Z ) ) - ( A ` 1 ) ) - sum_ k e. ( 2 ... N ) ( ( A ` k ) x. ( k ^c -u Z ) ) ) )
